abstract: >-
  This repository contains the source code for the MUDE
  Textbook from the 2024-25 academic year. It is the first
  version released with a CC BY license.  MUDE stands for
  Modelling, Uncertainty and Data for Engineers, a required
  module in the MSc programs from the faculty of Civil
  Engineering and Geosciences at Delft University of
  Technology in the Netherlands.
